Specification:
- Rockchip RK3588S
- RK806-2x2pcs + DiscretePower
- eMMC5.1 + SPI Flash
- Micro SD Card3.0
- 1 x Typec3.0 + 2 x USB2 HOST
- 1 x 1Lane PCIE2.0 Connector(RC Mode)
- Headphone output
- Array Key(MENU/VOL+/VOP-/ESC), Reset, Power on/off Key
- 6 x SARADC

